<style|<tuple|generic>>

<\body>
  A landscape page: the renderer is handed the width and the height
  already swapped by the typesetter, so the paper must come out wider
  than it is tall.

  <\wide-tabular>
    <tformat|<table|<row|<cell|left>|<cell|middle>|<cell|right>>>>
  </wide-tabular>
</body>

<initial|<\collection>
  <associate|page-orientation|landscape>
</collection>>
